{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026gZCJ32iu931795448912.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>太古配售國泰航空股份，集資近36億元。</p><p></p><p>太古按每股14.23元，配售2.52億股國泰股份，集資淨額約35.7億元，作為一般營運資金用途。配股價較周一收市價15.55元，折讓近百分之8.5。太古指，配售國泰股份，將可增加其營運資金，進一步強化資產負債表，及提高財務靈活性。完成配股後，太古將持有國泰約三成半權益。</p><p></p><p>太古指，無意就國泰的管治及管理安排，作出任何重大變動建議，並擬維持於國泰的重大長期策略性持股，亦無意進一步減少其於持股水平。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:17:37.105235+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":218,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T14:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T09:37:17.126690+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T16:10:45.546458+00:00","content_hash":"0419e250193587dac6ec45739393473b810333edee149aa46ff8f75c8c519d4a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T16:17:37.105235+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}